  },
  {
   "type": "narration",
   "speaker": "a",
   "text": "From then on, the army made the emperors, and the army killed them. In the year 238 alone, Rome had six.",
   "say": "From then on, the army made the emperors, and the army killed them. In the year two thirty-eight alone, Rome had six.",
